  m_text: 'Pre-sale is a process of selling NFTs to chosen investors before the official
    mint date. Their blockchain addresses are added to a special list called a whitelist
    (WL), which grants them early access to participate in the pre-sale

    This
    often occurs to reward early supporters with reduced price, for marketing complain,
    or to raise funds.'
